window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Her death magic prevents anyone from getting close to her. Until she meets him.</b></p> <p>Violet has only three goals: cure her sister's illness, find a job that doesn't involve getting into fights with pixies, and hide her soul-stealing abilities at all costs.</p> <p>Sounds easy, right? <i>Wrong.</i></p> <p>When she accidentally reveals her power, she's kidnapped and trapped in the realm that separates the worlds of human and fae. And that is a very dangerous place to be.</p> <p>He's a dark fae prince whose magic prevents him from being able to touch. Until he meets her.</p> <p>Blake wants nothing to do with his royal family, but refusing the queen's command is never an option. When he's forced to take on a quest, he sets off a chain of events that lead him to a castle filled with the dead. What he didn't expect was to find a woman with magic as dark as his.</p> <p>Contains mature themes.</p>"; 
